@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Administrator
rectangle "Smart Campus study room booking system" {
  usecase "View availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block / unblock room" as BlockRoom
  usecase "Review usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Receive confirmation" as ReceiveConfirmation
}
Student -- ViewAvailability
Student -- BookRoom
Student -- CancelBooking
Administrator -- BlockRoom
Administrator -- ReviewUsage
' why: R4, US-06, and the scenario make successful-booking confirmation conditional on success.
ReceiveConfirmation ..> BookRoom : <<extend>> [booking succeeds]
' why: US-06 and the scenario require confirmation after a successful cancellation.
ReceiveConfirmation ..> CancelBooking : <<extend>> [cancellation succeeds]
@enduml
